  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Better Migration Management (SBMM) Programme - Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Better Migration Management (BMM) programme is that national authorities and institutions are able to facilitate safe, orderly and regular migration and effectively address and reduce the trafficking in human beings and the smuggling of migrants within and from the Horn of Africa region through a rights-based approach. As Sudan was excluded from the third phase of the BMM programme, this is the Sudan specific third phase of the programme (SBMM), which is closely coordinated and aligned with the regional BMM.</narrative>
  </description>
